@node main "SimpleDock 1.1"
@{b}SimpleDock 1.1@{ub}  (21.10.2026)
A dock for AmigaOS 3.x, in the manner of macOS.

@{b}Start here@{ub}
  @{"What it is" link what} - in four sentences
  @{"What you need" link need} - AmigaOS 3.1.4 or later, a 68030, best with RTG
  @{"Installing" link install} - no installer: put it anywhere, double-click
  @{"The five things" link five} - click, drag on, drag off, drag along, the hotkey

@{b}Using it@{ub}
  @{"Running programs" link running} - the dot, click to front, Shift+click, Del
  @{"Long press" link longpress} - a program's windows: front, minimise, close
  @{"Auto-hide" link autohide} - the dock out of the way until you need it
  @{"Dropping files" link drops} - onto a program, into a drawer, onto the dock
  @{"Missing icons" link missing} - the dimmed "?" icon
  @{"Keys" link keys} - minimise, minimise all, auto-hide on/off
  @{"Shell drops" link shelldrops} - paths typed into a Shell; archives unpacked
  @{"Force Quit" link forcequit} - for a program that will not close

@{b}The settings window@{ub}
  @{"The simple side" link simple} - Place, Icons, Look
  @{"Fine-tune" link finetune} - pixels and numbers
  @{"Programs" link programs} - running programs, how they start, hidden ones
  @{"Shell drops and Keys" link advshell} - the two groups for the features above
  @{"System" link system} - font, screen, messages, beep, crash reports
  @{"The buttons" link buttons} - Undo changes, Load..., Save as...

@{b}Reference@{ub}
  @{"Shell icons and projects" link shellicons}
  @{"More than one dock" link moredocks}
  @{"The settings file" link configfile} - keywords, tooltypes, the command line
  @{"Keywords" link keywords} - all 42, one line each
  @{"ARexx" link arexx} - the port and every command

@{b}When something is wrong@{ub}
  @{"Known limitations" link limits}
  @{"Crash reports" link crash}
  @{"Bug reports" link bugs}
  @{"History" link history}

@{i}You can stop after Start here and have a working dock.@{ui}

